IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q03-SIMPLE-INTEREST.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-RATE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-YEARS           PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-INTEREST        PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL           PIC 9(12)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-INT        PIC Z(10)9.99.
01 WS-DISP-TOT        PIC Z(11)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL
ACCEPT WS-RATE
ACCEPT WS-YEARS
COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED = (WS-PRINCIPAL * WS-RATE * WS-YEARS) / 100
COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-PRINCIPAL + WS-INTEREST
MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-DISP-INT
MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-DISP-TOT
DISPLAY "Interest: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-INT)
DISPLAY "Total: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-TOT)
STOP RUN.
